      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silverton%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Now known as Meier's Wine Cellars, it is Ohio’s oldest and largest winery, founded by the Meier Grape Juice Company.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
